End-of-life data (data/eol.json)

data/eol.json is a snapshot of release lines, end-of-life dates, LTS start dates and latest
releases of Node.js, Python and Go, built by scripts/update-eol.mjs from:

  endoflife.date  https://endoflife.date  (API: https://endoflife.date/api/v1/products/)
  Repository: https://github.com/endoflife-date/endoflife.date
